+    """EXL3_MEM_LOG=N: every N s, log the torch allocator's reserved / allocated / peak-allocated VRAM (peak since the
+    last check) and the card's used VRAM (mem_get_info), when any changed. Card used minus torch reserved is what Level
+    Zero holds outside torch (graphs, kernel scratch, anything allocated around torch)."""
